{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-24","kind":"proposition","title":"铰链定理：夹角越大，对边越长","englishTitle":"If two triangles have the two sides equal to two sides respectively, but have the one of the angles contained by the equal straight lines greater than the other, they will also have the base greater than the base.","book":1,"number":24,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.24","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.24/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":24,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-24@raw-b12d969df70c96c4","contentId":"euclid-1-24","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b12d969df70c96c4d9c8d2643eb1aaf29b3255db9329b9fd200d5628a4a14651","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-24.statement","euclid-1-24.construction.1","euclid-1-24.proof.1","euclid-1-24.proof.2","euclid-1-24.proof.3","euclid-1-24.proof.4","euclid-1-24.proof.5","euclid-1-24.proof.6","euclid-1-24.proof.7","euclid-1-24.proof.8","euclid-1-24.conclusion","euclid-1-24.historical.1","euclid-1-24.historical.2","euclid-1-24.historical.3","euclid-1-24.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-24.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-24","revisionId":"euclid-1-24@raw-b12d969df70c96c4","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"44061696a94c8999a420c4ab4632ee9d14ff84dfcec695443b26b235f77fc5c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two triangles have the two sides equal to two sides respectively, but have the one of the angles contained by the equal straight lines greater than the other, they will also have the base greater than the base."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个三角形的两边分别等于两边,但有一个角由相等的直线构成,大于另一直线,那么它们也比底边大。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形相当之两腰各等若一形之腰间角大则底亦大"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个三角形有两条相等的边；如果形状相同的边之间的角较大，则底边也较大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-24.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-24","revisionId":"euclid-1-24@raw-b12d969df70c96c4","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"27ec1c78ef44c911c18bab99a2eabb9b6b7fd15b525ff356b8435cdb7b10452e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, DEF be two triangles having the two sides AB, AC equal to the two sides DE, DF respectively, namely AB to DE, and AC to DF, and let the angle at A be greater than the angle at D;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC、DEF成为两个三角,双方的AB、AC和DE等同,即AB至DE和AC至DF,让A角大于D角;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-24.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-24","revisionId":"euclid-1-24@raw-b12d969df70c96c4","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ca7c43db175858c5485fb7f253679298898628abd5316d58ee4e707f3ff44527","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the base BC is also greater than the base EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,底边 BC也大于底边 EF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-24.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-24","revisionId":"euclid-1-24@raw-b12d969df70c96c4","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b01962cf459883d6b0e1487b714f172208bc0917db0cff2423f432774dd8a27","citations":["euclid-1-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the angle BAC is greater than the angle EDF, let there be constructed, on the straight line DE, and at the point D on it, the angle EDG equal to the angle BAC; [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)] let DG be made equal to either of the two straight lines AC, DF, and let EG, FG be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为BAC角大于EDF角,所以在DE线直线上建造EDG角等于BAC角;DG角等于两条直线AC、DF,并连接EG、FG。 [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-24.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-24","revisionId":"euclid-1-24@raw-b12d969df70c96c4","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f27e332abb2e5dc7c44bb759ca39e0ceeea22262e3179a04b9ec320f730fa440","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AB is equal to DE, and AC to DG, the two sides BA, AC are equal to the two sides ED, DG, respectively; and the angle BAC is equal to the angle EDG; therefore the base BC is equal to the base EG. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"双方的BA、AC和DG等值为AB,BA、AC等值;BAC角等于EDG角;因此,底边、BC等值底边、EG等值。（相关点与线段：DE） [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-24.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-24","revisionId":"euclid-1-24@raw-b12d969df70c96c4","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bc9208a2f9ebde24f0898b73c81eacb081e95506caa39e466547148542d80238","citations":["euclid-1-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since DF is equal to DG, the angle DGF is also equal to the angle DFG; [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)] therefore the angle DFG is greater than the angle EGF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于DF等于DG,DGF角也等于DFG角,因此DFG角大于EGF角。 [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-24.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-24","revisionId":"euclid-1-24@raw-b12d969df70c96c4","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9dc70c728e40257806ca3b64dfe18ee4731391a7ebefddf761af332cb5dfc852","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angle EFG is much greater than the angle EGF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EFG角比EGF角更大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-24.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-24","revisionId":"euclid-1-24@raw-b12d969df70c96c4","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1a740612f9a877446fb86a006bbdb9d46c4c0ea31466914e6ff028b9e27ca929","citations":["euclid-1-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since EFG is a triangle having the angle EFG greater than the angle EGF, and the greater angle is subtended by the greater side, [[I. 19](/principles/euclid-1-19)] the side EG is also greater than EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"并且,EFG是一个三角形,其角度EFG大于角度EGF, 更大的数量角度被较大的数量角度所分解, EG的侧面也大于EF。 [[I. 19](/principles/euclid-1-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-24.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-1-24","revisionId":"euclid-1-24@raw-b12d969df70c96c4","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"788abdee67351ba4f78b4f3363673d84c60942763406f840c78a386fc45e5b90","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But EG is equal to BC. Therefore BC is also greater than EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EG等于BC,因此BC也大于EF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-24.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-1-24","revisionId":"euclid-1-24@raw-b12d969df70c96c4","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-24.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-24","revisionId":"euclid-1-24@raw-b12d969df70c96c4","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-24.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-24","revisionId":"euclid-1-24@raw-b12d969df70c96c4","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4aad32feced54d3f989364e5953d1156553f756b715ce598dbea6aa24459ed58","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形相当之两腰各等若一形之腰间角大则底亦大"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个三角形有两条相等的边；如果形状相同的边之间的角较大，则底边也较大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-24.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-24","revisionId":"euclid-1-24@raw-b12d969df70c96c4","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9901dddd8503e333124ff03055529f4c3f9f0b7aff77c489eaae82dc2a60d2c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙与丁戊己两角形其甲乙与丁戊两腰甲丙与丁巳两腰各等若乙甲丙角大于戊丁己角题言乙丙底必大于戊巳底"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"说明如下：甲乙丙 和 丁戊己 是两个三角形，甲乙 和 丁戊 的边等于 甲丙 和 丁巳 的边。如果 乙甲丙 的角度大于 戊丁己 的角度，则 乙丙 的底边必须大于 戊巳 的底边。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-24.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-24","revisionId":"euclid-1-24@raw-b12d969df70c96c4","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c12aba1d8854874a68f6c50a876ae1cded597a417e40c7a2f5d08b1a79d52613","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试依丁戊线从丁点作戊丁庚角与乙甲丙角等〈本篇卄三〉则戊丁庚角大于戊丁己角而丁庚腰在丁巳之外矣次截丁庚线与丁巳等〈本篇三〉即丁庚丁巳俱与甲丙等又自戊至庚作直线是甲乙与丁戊甲丙与丁庚腰线各等乙甲丙与戊丁庚两角亦等而乙丙与戊庚两底必等也〈本篇四〉次问所作戊庚底今在戊巳底上邪抑同在一线邪抑在其下邪若在上即如第二图自己至庚作直线则丁庚己角形之丁庚丁巳两腰等而丁庚己与丁己庚两角亦等矣〈本篇五〉夫戊庚己角乃丁庚己角之分必小于丁庚己亦必小于相等之丁巳庚而丁巳庚又戊己庚角之分则戊庚己益小于戊巳庚也〈公论九〉则对戊庚己小角之戊己腰必小于对戊己庚大角之戊庚腰也〈本篇十九〉若戊巳与戊庚两底同线即如第四图戊己乃戊庚之分则戊己必小于戊庚也〈公论九〉若戊庚在戊巳之下即如第六图自己至庚作直线次引丁庚线出于壬引丁巳线出于辛则丁庚丁巳两腰等而辛巳庚壬庚己两外角亦等矣〈本篇五〉夫戊庚己角乃壬庚己角之分必小于壬庚己亦必小于相等之辛巳庚而辛巳庚又戊己庚角之分则戊庚巳益小于戊己庚也〈公论九〉则对戊庚己小角之戊巳腰必小于对戊己庚大角之戊庚腰也〈本篇〉〈十九〉是三戊巳皆小于等戊庚之乙丙〈本篇四〉也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：根据线 丁戊，从点 丁 画角 戊丁庚 和 乙甲丙，〈本篇卄三〉 表示 戊丁庚 大于 戊丁己，丁庚 的腿在 丁巳 之外。接着，将线 丁庚 和 丁巳 平分。〈本篇三〉，即 丁庚丁巳 等于 甲丙。同时，从 戊 到 庚 画直线。角 甲乙、丁戊甲丙 和 丁庚 相等，角 乙甲丙 和 戊丁庚 相等，而 乙丙 和 戊庚 的底边必须相等。〈本篇四〉 问：戊庚 的底边现在是在 戊巳 上方，还是在同一条线上，或者在下方？如果在上方，则如图 2 所示，从 己 到 庚 画直线，则三角形 丁庚己 的两条腿 丁庚丁巳 相等，且 丁庚丁巳 等于 丁庚丁巳 的两条腿。〈本篇四〉 问：戊庚 的底边现在是在 戊巳 上方，还是在同一条线上，或者在下方？如果在上方，则如图 2 所示，从 己 到 庚 画直线，则三角形 丁庚丁巳 的两条腿相等，丁庚丁巳 等于 丁庚丁巳 和 丁庚丁巳。 和 丁庚丁巳 的腿相等。〈本篇四〉 问 戊庚 的底边是在 戊巳 上方，还是在同一条线上，或者在下方？如果在上方，则如图 2 所示，从 己 到 庚 画直线，丁庚丁巳 的两条腿相等，丁庚丁巳 的腿相等，丁庚丁巳 的腿也相等。〈本篇四〉 与 丁庚丁巳 相同，丁庚丁巳 的腿相等。〈本篇四〉 问：戊庚 的底边现在是在 戊巳 上方，还是在同一条线上，或者在下方？如果在上方，则如图 2 所示，从 己 到 庚，丁庚丁巳 和 丁庚丁巳 的两条腿相等，丁庚丁巳 的腿也相等，丁庚丁巳 的底边必须相等。〈本篇四〉 问两个角 039 和 丁己庚 也相等。〈本篇五〉。角 戊庚己 是 丁庚己 角的差值，因此 丁庚己 也必须小于等于 丁巳庚。如果 丁巳庚 和 戊己庚 不同，则 戊庚己 小于 戊巳庚。对于 〈公论九〉，小角 戊庚己 的 戊己 边必须小于大角 戊己庚 的 戊庚 边。〈本篇十九〉。如果 戊巳 和 戊庚 与图 4 中相同的底线，戊己 是 戊庚 的划分，则 戊己 必须小于 戊庚。〈公论九〉。如果 戊庚 在 戊巳 下方，如图 6 所示，从 己 到 庚 画直线，并从 壬 画出 丁庚，丁巳 线引出 辛，则 丁庚丁巳 有两条相等的腰，辛巳庚壬庚己 的两个外角也相等。〈本篇五〉，角 戊庚己 是 壬庚己，所以角的划分必须小于 壬庚己，也小于等于 辛巳庚。如果 辛巳庚 和 戊己庚 的角相等，则 戊庚巳 小于 戊己庚。对于 〈公论九〉，则对于 戊庚己，小角的 戊巳 腿必须小于对面的 戊己庚 大角、戊庚。〈本篇〉〈十九〉 三个 戊巳 全部等于 乙丙〈本篇四〉 的 戊庚。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-24.source","contentId":"euclid-1-24","revisionId":"euclid-1-24@raw-b12d969df70c96c4","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e1cd68610ebceb48af6eefbd767c71b092f7e9c057623855ce3537d335834936","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.24/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.24\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-24:euclid-1-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-24","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-24.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-23","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.24","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.24/","sourceLabel":"I. 23"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-24:euclid-1-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-24","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-24.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","so